  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "incorrect procedure guidance for nulling the demand and position signal in procedure N2-SOP-06, Feedwater Failures, Attachment 1, Restoration of 2FWS-LV10 Control. When the NORMAL/RESET switch (S10B) is placed to reset, the signal sent to the MIA station is from the non-selected position feedback potentiometer and not the potentiometer selected with the corresponding Feedback Potentiometer selector switch (S2B). This procedure error was introduced when the modification was implemented and not recognized.",
    "cause_code": "D",
    "category": "Defective Procedure",
    "theme": "procedure error in valve restoration sequence caused signal mismatch",
    "provisional": false
  },
